  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 301.21 Permitted production volume",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 301.21 “Permitted production volume” means the maximum volume of groundwater approved by the department to be withdrawn or pumped in any 24-hour period from a production well.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for Env-Dw 301) #11060, eff 4-1-16",
